WEBVTT

00:03:28.167 --> 00:03:30.393
of finance, of people

00:03:30.417 --> 00:03:32.226
and of ideas,

00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:34.226
and that now comes to an end

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:39.000
with events like the shutting down
of democracy in Hong Kong.

00:03:40.042 --> 00:03:43.184
The question now is, what's next?

00:03:43.208 --> 00:03:44.934
Well, if the era we're leaving

00:03:44.958 --> 00:03:48.601
was characterized by a connected world

00:03:48.625 --> 00:03:51.351
trying to shrink and come together

00:03:51.375 --> 00:03:53.184
on the basis of economic goals

00:03:53.208 --> 00:03:54.809
and geography,

00:03:54.833 --> 00:03:56.351
the new world order

00:03:56.375 --> 00:04:01.559
will be defined by rival, distinct
and different ways of doing things,